1
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:03,000
[♪ soft music playing]

2
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:27,990
[birds chirping]

3
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:33,330
[boy panting]

4
00:00:38,460 --> 00:00:39,870
[BOY] This is really bad!

5
00:00:39,920 --> 00:00:41,290
I'm a goner!

6
00:00:43,080 --> 00:00:44,340
[exclaims]

7
00:00:46,760 --> 00:00:48,010
[monster growls]

8
00:00:48,050 --> 00:00:49,590
[boy pants]

9
00:00:54,010 --> 00:00:55,810
[knights grunt]

10
00:00:55,850 --> 00:00:56,930
[KNIGHT 1] Hey!

11
00:00:57,730 --> 00:00:59,560
[♪ tense music playing]

12
00:01:01,190 --> 00:01:02,310
[KNIGHT 1] Shit!

13
00:01:02,350 --> 00:01:03,400
The fuath--

14
00:01:03,440 --> 00:01:04,980
O Great Zelkoff, hear me.

15
00:01:06,820 --> 00:01:09,400
[boy pants]

16
00:01:09,440 --> 00:01:11,780
What the heck
is she doing over here?

17
00:01:11,950 --> 00:01:14,370
Come on, let's go. Come on!

18
00:01:15,990 --> 00:01:17,450
[monster growls]

19
00:01:20,120 --> 00:01:21,620
[monsters munching]

20
00:01:23,500 --> 00:01:25,540
[KNIGHT 1]
I must catch the coffin thief!

21
00:01:25,590 --> 00:01:28,510
[MAN 1] No. We'll make
a run for it. Send the signal.

22
00:01:28,550 --> 00:01:31,840
[KNIGHT 1] Run? Like a coward?
But we swore to protect it.

23
00:01:34,600 --> 00:01:35,800
Oh, shit!

24
00:01:35,850 --> 00:01:37,310
This could be it for me!

25
00:01:37,350 --> 00:01:39,680
-[boy pants]
-[monster growls]

26
00:01:43,520 --> 00:01:46,110
[KNIGHT 1] It can't be!
You mean the Temple is--

27
00:01:49,190 --> 00:01:50,650
[KNIGHT 1] Please, help me!

28
00:01:50,690 --> 00:01:51,860
[screaming]

29
00:01:54,200 --> 00:01:55,320
[boy screams]

30
00:01:56,030 --> 00:01:57,950
[grunts]

31
00:02:01,500 --> 00:02:02,710
[groans]

32
00:02:03,460 --> 00:02:05,080
-[gasps]
-[monster growls]

33
00:02:10,670 --> 00:02:12,420
[gasps in fear]

34
00:02:14,930 --> 00:02:16,180
Xylo!

35
00:02:16,220 --> 00:02:18,510
Help me already!
It's gonna eat me!

36
00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:20,720
[♪ dramatic music playing]

37
00:02:22,890 --> 00:02:24,770
[grunts in effort]

38
00:02:30,150 --> 00:02:31,860
[monster growls]

39
00:02:53,170 --> 00:02:54,760
[boy screams]

40
00:02:54,930 --> 00:02:56,510
[boy pants]

41
00:02:56,590 --> 00:02:59,350
Stop moving!
You're gonna bleed out!

42
00:02:59,390 --> 00:03:01,060
It hurts. Let me die!

43
00:03:01,100 --> 00:03:02,890
You can have me
resurrected later!

44
00:03:02,930 --> 00:03:04,060
Shut your mouth!

45
00:03:04,100 --> 00:03:06,150
Like hell
I'll haul your corpse around.

46
00:03:06,310 --> 00:03:09,270
[BOY] I'm begging you!
I can't even use another body!

47
00:03:09,690 --> 00:03:11,530
I mean,
that's all they need to--

48
00:03:13,490 --> 00:03:15,900
Listen up. It's not that simple.

49
00:03:16,160 --> 00:03:19,620
Resurrecting a hero like us
means dragging their souls

50
00:03:19,660 --> 00:03:21,740
straight out of hell,
and jamming it back

51
00:03:21,790 --> 00:03:23,080
into their corpse.

52
00:03:23,450 --> 00:03:25,710
It takes a nasty toll
on your memory

53
00:03:25,750 --> 00:03:27,170
and sense of self.

54
00:03:27,250 --> 00:03:30,590
Have you died so many times
you forgot the price? Well?

55
00:03:30,670 --> 00:03:32,130
[breathes shakily]

56
00:03:33,340 --> 00:03:34,420
[Xylo sighs]

57
00:03:34,840 --> 00:03:37,260
[XYLO] In any case,
there is zero chance

58
00:03:37,300 --> 00:03:39,050
the Holy Knights
would even bother

59
00:03:39,090 --> 00:03:40,720
to retrieve your body.

60
00:03:44,600 --> 00:03:46,640
If you're so eager to die.

61
00:03:46,690 --> 00:03:47,900
[blows]

62
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:51,730
The least you can do
is wait until I'm not watching.

63
00:03:55,440 --> 00:03:58,240
Get ready to pull
and brace yourself.

64
00:03:58,910 --> 00:04:00,660
[boy breathes shakily]

65
00:04:02,660 --> 00:04:05,790
[XYLO] You know what's coming,
so grit your teeth.

66
00:04:06,410 --> 00:04:07,540
[grunts]

67
00:04:08,250 --> 00:04:10,500
[screams in pain]

68
00:04:22,180 --> 00:04:23,390
[sighs]

69
00:04:23,430 --> 00:04:26,810
[XYLO] Well,
you royally screwed up, moron.

70
00:04:29,190 --> 00:04:30,270
Dotta.

71
00:04:30,310 --> 00:04:32,980
Get a handle
on those sticky fingers.

72
00:04:33,070 --> 00:04:34,610
[DOTTA] Couldn't help it.

73
00:04:34,820 --> 00:04:38,320
I just so happened to spot
the Holy Knights transport team.

74
00:04:38,450 --> 00:04:40,070
Besides, isn't it their fault

75
00:04:40,110 --> 00:04:41,990
for leaving the carriage
undefended?

76
00:04:42,030 --> 00:04:44,870
It would've been far easier
not to steal from them.

77
00:04:44,910 --> 00:04:48,580
I only told you to get eyes
on the faeries. That's it.

78
00:04:50,830 --> 00:04:52,330
[gulps]

79
00:04:55,630 --> 00:04:56,760
[DOTTA] Xylo.

80
00:04:58,420 --> 00:05:01,180
I saw a lot of faeries
out there.

81
00:05:01,840 --> 00:05:03,800
[XYLO] Yeah, we're up against

82
00:05:03,850 --> 00:05:06,010
a massive Demon Blight
this time.

83
00:05:06,060 --> 00:05:08,100
According
to Command Central's briefing,

84
00:05:08,140 --> 00:05:09,890
it's around 5,000.

85
00:05:09,980 --> 00:05:11,440
[stammering] Five thousand?

86
00:05:11,480 --> 00:05:13,770
They can't expect us
to hold that many at bay

87
00:05:13,810 --> 00:05:14,980
all by ourselves!

88
00:05:15,020 --> 00:05:16,150
[XYLO] They do.

89
00:05:16,400 --> 00:05:17,900
The Demon Blight

90
00:05:17,940 --> 00:05:20,820
will soon corrupt
this entire forest.

91
00:05:21,030 --> 00:05:22,240
We're here to help

92
00:05:22,280 --> 00:05:24,320
those pathetic holy knights
retreat.

93
00:05:24,370 --> 00:05:27,200
No choice.
And don't expect backup.

94
00:05:27,240 --> 00:05:28,330
[gasps]

95
00:05:29,450 --> 00:05:31,790
Don't get any funny ideas,
either.

96
00:05:31,830 --> 00:05:32,830
Try to run away,

97
00:05:32,870 --> 00:05:34,880
and they'll blow your head
clean off.

98
00:05:36,380 --> 00:05:37,630
[DOTTA] It's fine.

99
00:05:37,670 --> 00:05:39,130
Why should I care?

100
00:05:39,170 --> 00:05:41,590
I'm a hero,
so I can just be resurrected

101
00:05:41,630 --> 00:05:42,930
if things go south.

102
00:05:42,970 --> 00:05:45,640
As long as there's a body,
whether it's mine

103
00:05:45,680 --> 00:05:47,260
or someone else's.

104
00:05:47,310 --> 00:05:49,310
[XYLO] You don't get it, do you?

105
00:05:49,850 --> 00:05:52,980
Every time you lose
another chunk of who you are,

106
00:05:53,150 --> 00:05:55,400
and before long,
you become little more

107
00:05:55,440 --> 00:05:57,110
than a walking corpse.

108
00:05:59,320 --> 00:06:00,940
I refuse.

109
00:06:01,820 --> 00:06:04,200
That will not be my fate.

110
00:06:06,700 --> 00:06:09,660
Heroes are tools
with no autonomy.

111
00:06:11,540 --> 00:06:12,750
[satisfied sigh]

112
00:06:12,960 --> 00:06:15,500
We're here
to carry out our missions.

113
00:06:16,380 --> 00:06:18,420
And that's all there is to it.

114
00:06:19,960 --> 00:06:22,130
Delusions won't save you.

115
00:06:22,630 --> 00:06:23,930
Let's get out of here.

116
00:06:23,970 --> 00:06:25,470
[Dotta groans]

117
00:06:25,510 --> 00:06:28,060
[XYLO] Can't sit idly by
while they tear apart the night.

118
00:06:28,100 --> 00:06:29,220
Huh?

119
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:30,970
[insects chirping]

120
00:06:37,150 --> 00:06:39,150
What is this thing?

121
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:48,910
[XYLO] Wait, is that... ?

122
00:06:49,280 --> 00:06:51,540
-Are you out of your mind?
-[Dotta gasps]

123
00:06:51,580 --> 00:06:52,910
What kind of crap is this?

124
00:06:52,950 --> 00:06:55,330
Stealing a coffin
and dragging it back here?

125
00:06:55,370 --> 00:06:57,750
Good question. I can explain.

126
00:06:57,790 --> 00:06:59,380
See, it looked real valuable,

127
00:06:59,420 --> 00:07:01,840
and one thing led to another,
as it does...

128
00:07:01,880 --> 00:07:04,130
So, anyway, I thought
it might come in handy,

129
00:07:04,170 --> 00:07:05,630
that's why I brought it along.

130
00:07:05,680 --> 00:07:07,890
[XYLO] Idiot!
Do you really think this junk

131
00:07:07,930 --> 00:07:09,470
was worth a faerie bite?

132
00:07:10,720 --> 00:07:13,390
You're kidding me. Dotta.

133
00:07:13,680 --> 00:07:15,350
This thing had better be empty.

134
00:07:15,430 --> 00:07:17,560
-[DOTTA] I don't know.
-[XYLO] You what?

135
00:07:17,600 --> 00:07:19,560
[DOTTA]
I mean, it seemed pretty heavy,

136
00:07:19,610 --> 00:07:21,020
while I was carrying it.

137
00:07:21,070 --> 00:07:23,440
[XYLO] Why in the hell
would you steal a corpse?

138
00:07:23,480 --> 00:07:25,150
Even for you,
that makes no sense.

139
00:07:25,200 --> 00:07:27,820
[DOTTA] What can I say?
It just happened, all right?

140
00:07:27,860 --> 00:07:29,820
I acted without even thinking.

141
00:07:29,870 --> 00:07:32,870
Anyway, that whole place
was already swarmed by faeries.

142
00:07:32,910 --> 00:07:34,040
[gasps]

143
00:07:34,080 --> 00:07:35,790
Stop talking,

144
00:07:35,830 --> 00:07:38,880
or I may kill you
before the faeries can.

145
00:07:39,290 --> 00:07:41,710
Wait, don't be hasty.
We can leave it here

146
00:07:41,750 --> 00:07:43,670
if we don't want it,
then come get it.

147
00:07:43,710 --> 00:07:45,090
If the knights are angry.

148
00:07:45,130 --> 00:07:47,590
-[Xylo sighs, grunts]
-[giggles]

149
00:07:47,880 --> 00:07:49,640
[insects chirping]

150
00:07:55,270 --> 00:07:57,190
[XYLO]
From the looks of this coffin,

151
00:07:57,230 --> 00:08:01,400
it's the body of a royal, noble,
or high ranking Holy Knight.

152
00:08:01,560 --> 00:08:03,070
If I'm lucky,

153
00:08:03,150 --> 00:08:05,820
it'll be one of the people
I've been wanting to knock out.

154
00:08:06,900 --> 00:08:08,780
[♪ angelic music playing]

155
00:08:08,820 --> 00:08:11,740
[DOTTA] Well, she looks like
someone important.

156
00:08:11,780 --> 00:08:13,080
[XYLO] She is.

157
00:08:13,120 --> 00:08:15,750
-[XYLO] And we're in trouble.
-[DOTTA] I figured.

158
00:08:15,790 --> 00:08:17,750
She's gotta be a princess.

159
00:08:17,790 --> 00:08:19,040
[XYLO] If only.

160
00:08:20,130 --> 00:08:22,340
She isn't even a human.

161
00:08:23,210 --> 00:08:25,840
That kid is a goddess.

162
00:08:26,050 --> 00:08:27,470
What do you mean?

163
00:08:27,510 --> 00:08:29,130
[XYLO] What I just said!

164
00:08:29,260 --> 00:08:30,970
You stole a damn goddess!

165
00:08:31,010 --> 00:08:32,600
That cannot be true.

166
00:08:32,680 --> 00:08:34,220
Aren't goddesses
a type of weapon

167
00:08:34,260 --> 00:08:36,930
created a long time ago
to fight demon lords?

168
00:08:36,980 --> 00:08:38,520
That's right.

169
00:08:38,560 --> 00:08:42,060
Humanity's last ray of hope.
Or that was the idea, anyway.

170
00:08:42,190 --> 00:08:45,320
I don't understand.
She looks like a little girl.

171
00:08:45,360 --> 00:08:47,070
But the goddesses
I've heard about

172
00:08:47,110 --> 00:08:49,240
were enormous,
whalelike creatures,

173
00:08:49,280 --> 00:08:50,410
or giant hunks of iron.

174
00:08:50,450 --> 00:08:51,530
[horn blaring]

175
00:08:51,570 --> 00:08:53,620
Time to move.
Leave her in the coffin.

176
00:08:53,660 --> 00:08:54,830
Right.

177
00:08:57,160 --> 00:08:58,500
[Dotta breathes shakily]

178
00:08:58,540 --> 00:09:01,080
[DOTTA] A hunting horn?
Think it's the knights?

179
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:04,290
Judging by the loud volume,
it's a scouting party

180
00:09:04,340 --> 00:09:05,710
or flying column.

181
00:09:05,750 --> 00:09:08,510
Their status.
You can see them, can't you?

182
00:09:08,550 --> 00:09:09,670
[Dotta ponders]

183
00:09:10,430 --> 00:09:11,720
[DOTTA] Looks like...

184
00:09:11,930 --> 00:09:13,800
a band of fuath...

185
00:09:13,890 --> 00:09:15,010
and...

186
00:09:16,060 --> 00:09:18,230
people dead or dying.

187
00:09:18,850 --> 00:09:20,060
[knight 1 pants]

188
00:09:21,100 --> 00:09:22,230
[knight 1 grunts]

189
00:09:23,360 --> 00:09:24,730
Help me!

190
00:09:26,230 --> 00:09:27,780
[pants]

191
00:09:28,990 --> 00:09:30,570
[grunts]

192
00:09:31,280 --> 00:09:32,450
[yells fiercely]

193
00:09:34,160 --> 00:09:35,330
[gasps]

194
00:09:36,280 --> 00:09:37,700
[knight 2 screams]

195
00:09:38,330 --> 00:09:40,290
[KNIGHT 3]
Shit! There are too many!

196
00:09:40,660 --> 00:09:43,580
Hold the line, men,
no matter what happens!

197
00:09:45,290 --> 00:09:47,050
[knight 4 screams]

198
00:09:48,710 --> 00:09:49,960
[thud]

199
00:09:51,670 --> 00:09:54,140
[XYLO] It's spreading faster
than I expected.

200
00:09:54,180 --> 00:09:56,510
They would've been prepared
for faerie attacks,

201
00:09:56,560 --> 00:09:57,640
but nothing like this.

202
00:09:57,680 --> 00:09:59,350
I've heard enough! Let's go!

203
00:09:59,390 --> 00:10:02,770
We should hide somewhere
until it's over.

204
00:10:02,810 --> 00:10:05,270
[XYLO] There's still a chance
for some of them.

205
00:10:05,310 --> 00:10:06,400
[DOTTA] Huh?

206
00:10:06,770 --> 00:10:09,230
[XYLO] A few stubborn asses
who won't die.

207
00:10:09,280 --> 00:10:11,610
It's in our best interest
to save them.

208
00:10:11,650 --> 00:10:12,820
[DOTTA] Are you insane?

209
00:10:12,860 --> 00:10:14,740
How is dying
in our best interest?

210
00:10:14,780 --> 00:10:16,160
Remember the mission.

211
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:18,450
Help the majority
of the knights escape.

212
00:10:18,490 --> 00:10:20,450
Every person we manage to save

213
00:10:20,500 --> 00:10:22,500
increases
our chances of success.

214
00:10:22,540 --> 00:10:24,330
-[DOTTA] Huh?
-[XYLO] We're fighting.

215
00:10:24,370 --> 00:10:25,710
I'll save 'em quickly.

216
00:10:26,040 --> 00:10:29,340
Before the sun sets,
we'll run down the cliff.

217
00:10:29,380 --> 00:10:31,470
-[GIRL] We're fighting!
-[gasps]

218
00:10:31,760 --> 00:10:33,300
[GIRL] I'll...

219
00:10:33,340 --> 00:10:34,510
save them.

220
00:10:37,760 --> 00:10:39,140
Wonderful!

221
00:10:40,010 --> 00:10:42,270
Such lovely words.

222
00:10:42,560 --> 00:10:45,270
There is no mistaking
that you are my knight.

223
00:10:45,310 --> 00:10:46,440
[grunts softly]

224
00:10:46,690 --> 00:10:48,320
[GIRL] A good start.

225
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:50,730
I deem your efforts passable.

226
00:10:51,570 --> 00:10:53,530
It is your courage

227
00:10:53,950 --> 00:10:56,660
that has made you
worthy of a goddess.

228
00:10:56,700 --> 00:10:57,990
[knife clinks]

229
00:11:00,200 --> 00:11:02,450
[GIRL]
Is there not a battle afoot?

230
00:11:02,870 --> 00:11:04,290
And lo,

231
00:11:04,330 --> 00:11:06,870
'tis a battle to save
the precious lives of others.

232
00:11:06,920 --> 00:11:08,170
So be it.

233
00:11:08,210 --> 00:11:10,800
From a goddess, to her knight.

234
00:11:10,840 --> 00:11:13,550
Your victory
is henceforth guaranteed!

235
00:11:13,590 --> 00:11:15,930
[Xylo gasps]

236
00:11:15,970 --> 00:11:20,100
[GIRL] In that hour,
when all enemies lie lifeless,

237
00:11:20,140 --> 00:11:22,810
your voice
shall sing my praises.

238
00:11:23,100 --> 00:11:24,560
And your hand

239
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:27,600
shall lavish pats upon my head!

240
00:11:27,650 --> 00:11:28,770
[Dotta gasps]

241
00:11:29,690 --> 00:11:30,770
[groans]

242
00:11:30,820 --> 00:11:33,230
You may pat away
to your heart's content!

243
00:11:33,280 --> 00:11:35,900
No amount of praise
could properly honor the majesty

244
00:11:35,950 --> 00:11:37,280
that is a goddess.

245
00:11:37,700 --> 00:11:39,490
I shall even permit you
to compose

246
00:11:39,530 --> 00:11:41,330
a song of veneration to me!

247
00:11:41,580 --> 00:11:43,040
[XYLO] Dauntless pride

248
00:11:43,080 --> 00:11:45,500
and a fierce desire
for recognition.

249
00:11:45,700 --> 00:11:47,750
She's a legitimate goddess.

250
00:11:47,790 --> 00:11:49,290
Huh? Are you sure?

251
00:11:49,500 --> 00:11:50,920
[XYLO] Dead sure.

252
00:11:50,960 --> 00:11:53,300
We're in the presence
of a goddess.

253
00:11:53,340 --> 00:11:57,550
Most likely the 13th one,
who has yet to be activated.

254
00:11:57,590 --> 00:12:00,300
I am the great goddess Teoritta,

255
00:12:00,350 --> 00:12:04,140
the guardian who bestows
blessings upon mankind!

256
00:12:04,180 --> 00:12:05,850
Teoritta.

257
00:12:06,270 --> 00:12:08,020
[TEORITTA] Speak, my knight.

258
00:12:08,060 --> 00:12:10,230
Put a word that what you seek.

259
00:12:10,520 --> 00:12:14,360
And I shall then lend form
to your prayer with great ease,

260
00:12:14,400 --> 00:12:17,070
for that
is my sole reason for being.

261
00:12:17,110 --> 00:12:18,200
[grunts]

262
00:12:18,530 --> 00:12:21,120
That's enough.
You know there's more.

263
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:22,490
Don't be dumb.

264
00:12:22,530 --> 00:12:23,780
[Teoritta gasps]

265
00:12:23,830 --> 00:12:26,790
There's nothing I hate more
than a goddess.

266
00:12:26,830 --> 00:12:28,500
[horn blaring]

267
00:12:28,580 --> 00:12:29,790
Dotta.

268
00:12:29,830 --> 00:12:31,920
[XYLO] Hurry up,
find somewhere to hide her.

269
00:12:31,960 --> 00:12:33,130
[Dotta stammers]

270
00:12:33,170 --> 00:12:35,920
[XYLO] I refuse
to ask a goddess for help!

271
00:12:35,960 --> 00:12:37,840
[DOTTA]
What am I supposed to do?

272
00:12:37,880 --> 00:12:39,430
[♪ tense music playing]

273
00:12:46,390 --> 00:12:47,430
Dotta.

274
00:12:47,480 --> 00:12:49,440
Directions and distance
are on you.

275
00:12:49,480 --> 00:12:51,270
Where are they
most concentrated?

276
00:12:51,310 --> 00:12:53,810
[DOTTA] For the record,
I advise against this.

277
00:12:53,860 --> 00:12:55,020
[XYLO] I didn't ask!

278
00:12:55,070 --> 00:12:56,820
A good distraction
is the only way

279
00:12:56,860 --> 00:12:58,400
to support the retreat.

280
00:12:58,450 --> 00:12:59,740
Have it your way!

281
00:12:59,780 --> 00:13:01,200
You always do.

282
00:13:02,280 --> 00:13:04,240
-[knights grunt]
-[monsters growl]

283
00:13:06,160 --> 00:13:07,450
[groans]

284
00:13:07,620 --> 00:13:10,830
They're at ten o'clock!
One finger's width to nine.

285
00:13:11,420 --> 00:13:12,710
That way, huh?

286
00:13:12,750 --> 00:13:14,000
[TEORITTA] Fascinating.

287
00:13:14,290 --> 00:13:17,170
You diminutive squire
has excellent eyesight.

288
00:13:17,210 --> 00:13:19,420
The hell?
What are you doing here?

289
00:13:19,510 --> 00:13:21,340
[♪ dramatic music playing]

290
00:13:21,380 --> 00:13:22,430
[monster growls]

291
00:13:22,510 --> 00:13:25,010
Assisting.
For I am true to my word.

292
00:13:25,050 --> 00:13:26,930
My knight
shall taste sweet victory!

293
00:13:26,970 --> 00:13:28,600
I don't need your assistance!

294
00:13:29,480 --> 00:13:31,480
[monsters growl]

295
00:13:35,320 --> 00:13:36,570
[Teoritta gasps]

296
00:13:36,610 --> 00:13:39,610
-They will soon be upon us!
-Stay out of it!

297
00:13:43,160 --> 00:13:46,160
If you wanna help,
leave me alone!

298
00:13:54,750 --> 00:13:56,250
[Teoritta grunts]

299
00:13:58,340 --> 00:13:59,710
[gasps]

300
00:14:00,880 --> 00:14:02,590
[TEORITTA] What was that power?

301
00:14:02,630 --> 00:14:06,350
A sacred seal of heat and light.
Now stay here and hide yourself.

302
00:14:06,430 --> 00:14:08,100
[knight grunts in effort]

303
00:14:11,140 --> 00:14:14,060
We'll keep them occupied.
Hurry and--

304
00:14:15,190 --> 00:14:16,610
[monster growls]

305
00:14:17,900 --> 00:14:19,400
[Xylo grunts]

306
00:14:21,570 --> 00:14:22,740
[Dotta gasps]

307
00:14:23,280 --> 00:14:24,490
Ugh.

308
00:14:24,530 --> 00:14:26,570
-I think I'm gonna be sick.
-[XYLO] Dotta!

309
00:14:26,660 --> 00:14:29,200
There's no time to waste.
Get in there!

310
00:14:29,240 --> 00:14:30,830
Just keep firing.

311
00:14:32,290 --> 00:14:34,500
Sure.
I've just gotta prepare myself.

312
00:14:34,580 --> 00:14:35,670
[gasps]

313
00:14:37,630 --> 00:14:39,300
Hold on! I'm not ready!

314
00:14:46,680 --> 00:14:48,140
[gasps in awe]

315
00:14:48,350 --> 00:14:50,430
I hit it. That was amazing!

316
00:14:50,470 --> 00:14:52,350
And with just
an old thunder staff.

317
00:14:52,390 --> 00:14:55,190
Missing would be more impressive
with these numbers.

318
00:14:56,020 --> 00:14:59,900
Keep up the support fire,
and don't you dare hit me!

319
00:15:00,110 --> 00:15:01,190
[Teoritta pants]

320
00:15:01,230 --> 00:15:03,070
I am here, young squire!

321
00:15:03,110 --> 00:15:05,450
Worry not, for we shall prevail!

322
00:15:05,490 --> 00:15:07,700
Well,
the outlook's not promising.

323
00:15:07,740 --> 00:15:09,160
Oh, you look tired.

324
00:15:09,200 --> 00:15:11,540
So why don't you go ahead
and get some rest?

325
00:15:16,420 --> 00:15:17,630
[grunts]

326
00:15:17,750 --> 00:15:19,420
Those are the last survivors!

327
00:15:19,460 --> 00:15:21,210
-[XYLO] I'll get them.
-Huh?

328
00:15:27,010 --> 00:15:29,140
To hell with you!

329
00:15:35,850 --> 00:15:36,980
[grunts]

330
00:15:38,480 --> 00:15:39,730
[moans]

331
00:15:42,820 --> 00:15:44,150
[monster growls]

332
00:15:48,950 --> 00:15:51,530
Sorry, that was so close,
but it's harder to hit

333
00:15:51,580 --> 00:15:52,700
when I'm far away.

334
00:15:52,740 --> 00:15:54,040
Just keep it up!

335
00:15:54,290 --> 00:15:56,710
I'm going to finish them off!

336
00:15:56,750 --> 00:15:58,000
For real?

337
00:15:58,040 --> 00:16:00,420
[hesitates] Here I come!

338
00:16:01,460 --> 00:16:03,920
Take heart
in what I swore to you!

339
00:16:04,840 --> 00:16:06,630
Patience, my knight.

340
00:16:06,670 --> 00:16:08,930
[Teoritta grunts, pants]

341
00:16:12,680 --> 00:16:14,890
[owls coo]

342
00:16:14,930 --> 00:16:16,310
[insects chirping]

343
00:16:17,850 --> 00:16:20,100
[metal rattles]

344
00:16:21,190 --> 00:16:24,440
[XYLO] Ah, I see you survived.

345
00:16:26,150 --> 00:16:29,450
[KNIGHT 1] You saved us. And
I didn't expect reinforcements.

346
00:16:29,570 --> 00:16:32,330
[XYLO] Get out of here, quickly!

347
00:16:32,370 --> 00:16:33,870
But what of you?

348
00:16:34,080 --> 00:16:36,830
Wait! You are one
of those monstrous penal heroes.

349
00:16:36,870 --> 00:16:38,540
In our own midst?

350
00:16:38,580 --> 00:16:40,080
[KNIGHT 2] A capital offender?

351
00:16:40,120 --> 00:16:41,840
[KNIGHT 3]
What is he doing here?

352
00:16:41,880 --> 00:16:44,090
Saved by his kind...

353
00:16:44,300 --> 00:16:45,960
[Dotta and Teoritta pant]

354
00:16:49,590 --> 00:16:51,590
[DOTTA]
I don't like the looks of this.

355
00:16:53,720 --> 00:16:56,890
[XYLO] I have my orders.
So you can retreat already.

356
00:16:56,930 --> 00:16:58,890
A new horde is fast approaching.

357
00:16:58,940 --> 00:17:01,060
That call is not yours!

358
00:17:02,440 --> 00:17:04,440
Being saved
by a scoundrel like you

359
00:17:04,770 --> 00:17:06,190
tarnishes our honor!

360
00:17:08,030 --> 00:17:09,650
I'm a little confused.

361
00:17:09,740 --> 00:17:12,740
Shouldn't this be the part
where these guys thank us?

362
00:17:13,160 --> 00:17:15,240
That's how it goes for heroes.

363
00:17:15,280 --> 00:17:17,120
Now point that sword
somewhere else.

364
00:17:17,160 --> 00:17:19,370
Your intentions are clear,
my knight.

365
00:17:19,410 --> 00:17:22,460
It would be most ignoble
to abandon these lost souls.

366
00:17:22,630 --> 00:17:24,790
-[Xylo gasps]
-I see right through you.

367
00:17:24,840 --> 00:17:26,630
-[KNIGHT 4] Hold on.
-[Xylo gasps]

368
00:17:27,510 --> 00:17:30,590
Your glowing hair
and brilliant red eyes.

369
00:17:30,630 --> 00:17:33,260
You look like...

370
00:17:33,300 --> 00:17:35,930
What are lowlifes like you
doing with her?

371
00:17:35,970 --> 00:17:38,520
We gave her
to the transport team!

372
00:17:38,560 --> 00:17:39,980
[swords rattle]

373
00:17:42,730 --> 00:17:43,940
[sighs]

374
00:17:46,150 --> 00:17:47,570
Answer me!

375
00:17:48,650 --> 00:17:50,110
[XYLO] If I do,

376
00:17:50,240 --> 00:17:52,280
will you lower your swords?

377
00:17:52,820 --> 00:17:54,280
[Teoritta gasps softly]

378
00:17:55,450 --> 00:17:56,580
[sighs]

379
00:18:00,750 --> 00:18:02,540
Hey, take it easy!

380
00:18:02,580 --> 00:18:05,290
This is no time for squabbling
amongst ourselves.

381
00:18:05,330 --> 00:18:07,750
Another wave is coming.
We have to move quickly!

382
00:18:07,800 --> 00:18:08,840
[mic feedback]

383
00:18:08,880 --> 00:18:11,130
[MAN] Xylo! Dotta!
Can you hear me?

384
00:18:11,170 --> 00:18:13,720
Venetim, you need to warn us
before you do that!

385
00:18:13,760 --> 00:18:15,340
[VENETIM] We're in deep trouble.

386
00:18:15,390 --> 00:18:17,060
Everything's falling to pieces.

387
00:18:17,100 --> 00:18:18,470
It's a complete mess!

388
00:18:18,810 --> 00:18:19,930
Be more specific.

389
00:18:19,970 --> 00:18:21,980
You think everything
is a complete mess.

390
00:18:22,020 --> 00:18:23,980
[VENETIM]
I mean it! It's such a mess,

391
00:18:24,020 --> 00:18:25,940
It could spell the end
for all of us.

392
00:18:26,230 --> 00:18:27,940
Xylo, do you have a minute?

393
00:18:27,980 --> 00:18:29,110
[XYLO] Hell, no!

394
00:18:29,730 --> 00:18:31,530
-[monster growls]
-[thud]

395
00:18:33,570 --> 00:18:35,450
[XYLO]
I'm assuming you heard that.

396
00:18:35,490 --> 00:18:37,830
Still think I'm free to chat?

397
00:18:38,160 --> 00:18:40,660
[VENETIM] I'll admit
it sounds like a bad time.

398
00:18:40,700 --> 00:18:42,500
But if I don't tell you now,

399
00:18:42,540 --> 00:18:45,120
you'll absolutely be angry
at me later.

400
00:18:45,170 --> 00:18:46,500
[XYLO] Then spit it out!

401
00:18:46,670 --> 00:18:48,710
[VENETIM]
The Holy Knights' main force

402
00:18:48,750 --> 00:18:50,340
is currently
marching straight

403
00:18:50,380 --> 00:18:51,510
for the Demon Blight.

404
00:18:51,550 --> 00:18:52,720
[gasps]

405
00:18:53,420 --> 00:18:54,970
[insects chirping]

406
00:18:56,720 --> 00:18:59,390
[KNIGHT 1] Understood.
Report to the Temple at once.

407
00:18:59,430 --> 00:19:00,600
[KNIGHT 2] Sir!

408
00:19:01,600 --> 00:19:02,730
[background chatter]

409
00:19:02,770 --> 00:19:05,060
[XYLO] Venetim, say that again.

410
00:19:05,100 --> 00:19:06,560
[gasps]

411
00:19:06,650 --> 00:19:09,190
You'll be angry at me later
if I don't tell you now, so--

412
00:19:09,230 --> 00:19:11,530
-[XYLO] Not that! Next part!
-[mic feedback]

413
00:19:11,570 --> 00:19:13,820
[VENETIM] Right.
It appears the Holy Knights

414
00:19:13,860 --> 00:19:16,320
stationed in the forest
over there have regrouped.

415
00:19:16,360 --> 00:19:18,660
They're forming ranks,
and preparing for battle

416
00:19:18,700 --> 00:19:19,780
against the blight.

417
00:19:19,990 --> 00:19:21,740
Those soldiers
seem to be dead set

418
00:19:21,790 --> 00:19:23,960
on stopping it
from advancing any further.

419
00:19:24,000 --> 00:19:25,830
The hell?
What are they thinking?

420
00:19:25,870 --> 00:19:27,630
[VENETIM]
I obviously have no clue

421
00:19:27,670 --> 00:19:28,880
what's gotten into them.

422
00:19:28,920 --> 00:19:30,340
Hey!

423
00:19:30,380 --> 00:19:32,760
What's your captain playing at
with this last stand?

424
00:19:32,800 --> 00:19:34,920
You have a direct order
to retreat.

425
00:19:39,550 --> 00:19:41,390
Don't tell me.

426
00:19:41,850 --> 00:19:44,730
[XYLO] Was this your genius plan
from the outset?

427
00:19:44,770 --> 00:19:45,940
[grunts]

428
00:19:50,060 --> 00:19:53,690
[KNIGHT] That's right.
Captain Kivia gave us the order.

429
00:19:53,820 --> 00:19:56,900
Kivia?
That fool sent you to die.

430
00:19:56,950 --> 00:19:58,160
How dare you?

431
00:19:58,570 --> 00:20:01,620
Our captain
has our unwavering trust.

432
00:20:01,830 --> 00:20:03,620
We fight for the captain's honor

433
00:20:03,660 --> 00:20:05,790
and for that
of the Holy Knights.

434
00:20:05,960 --> 00:20:07,080
We would not hesitate

435
00:20:07,120 --> 00:20:09,380
to lay down our lives
for either.

436
00:20:11,790 --> 00:20:12,880
[Xylo chuckles]

437
00:20:12,920 --> 00:20:14,380
Pathetic.

438
00:20:15,460 --> 00:20:18,550
What do you think you'll achieve
in the state that you're in?

439
00:20:18,590 --> 00:20:21,470
[VENETIM] Um, going back
to what I was talking about.

440
00:20:21,510 --> 00:20:23,140
Whatever it is, say it already!

441
00:20:23,180 --> 00:20:25,680
[VENETIM] Shouldn't you
just rescue them?

442
00:20:25,730 --> 00:20:27,980
If over half
of the Holy Knights die,

443
00:20:28,020 --> 00:20:30,350
that's a failed mission
for the Hero Unit.

444
00:20:31,230 --> 00:20:32,820
You won't simply die.

445
00:20:32,860 --> 00:20:35,440
You might get resurrected
and burned at the stake.

446
00:20:35,480 --> 00:20:37,200
Regardless,
it will be painful

447
00:20:37,240 --> 00:20:38,780
and quite unpleasant.

448
00:20:39,200 --> 00:20:41,490
That sounds bad. What now, Xylo?

449
00:20:41,530 --> 00:20:44,160
[TEORITTA] Why has your heart
fallen to such despair?

450
00:20:44,200 --> 00:20:47,040
There can be no greater honor
than to save another soul

451
00:20:47,080 --> 00:20:48,210
from certain peril.

452
00:20:48,290 --> 00:20:49,750
Am I wrong, my knight?

453
00:20:49,790 --> 00:20:51,580
[XYLO] Quiet, both of you!

454
00:20:52,380 --> 00:20:55,210
Venetim. How far
have the dead men walking

455
00:20:55,250 --> 00:20:56,250
made it?

456
00:20:56,300 --> 00:20:58,970
[VENETIM]
Huh? Oh, uh, they, um--

457
00:20:59,010 --> 00:21:01,010
[XYLO]
You're just now looking into it?

458
00:21:01,050 --> 00:21:03,220
Of course not.
What do you take me for?

459
00:21:03,260 --> 00:21:06,350
I believe they've gathered
at the second crossing point

460
00:21:06,390 --> 00:21:07,890
along the Purcell River.

461
00:21:07,930 --> 00:21:09,600
Do whatever you can.

462
00:21:09,640 --> 00:21:11,730
The second crossing point.

463
00:21:11,770 --> 00:21:13,190
[♪ tense music playing]

464
00:21:13,230 --> 00:21:15,610
[XYLO] Don't even think
about joining up with them,

465
00:21:15,650 --> 00:21:17,940
unless
you want to be a hindrance.

466
00:21:18,530 --> 00:21:20,110
[KNIGHT] We made a choice.

467
00:21:20,150 --> 00:21:23,700
Vow to fight and die
alongside Captain Kivia.

468
00:21:23,740 --> 00:21:26,040
It's not something
a hero would understand.

469
00:21:26,080 --> 00:21:28,660
[XYLO]
Just head south and get lost.

470
00:21:29,160 --> 00:21:30,660
We drove back the faeries

471
00:21:30,710 --> 00:21:32,750
that were attacking
your flying column.

472
00:21:32,790 --> 00:21:33,880
You did?

473
00:21:34,090 --> 00:21:36,340
[XYLO] Retreat to the south end
of the forest,

474
00:21:36,380 --> 00:21:38,550
and you'll find the team
that oversees us.

475
00:21:38,710 --> 00:21:41,680
Give that ass Venetim
a black eye for me.

476
00:21:43,680 --> 00:21:44,890
I'll handle this.

477
00:21:44,930 --> 00:21:46,720
And then
give that captain of yours

478
00:21:46,760 --> 00:21:48,100
a piece of my mind.

479
00:21:48,640 --> 00:21:49,770
[grunts]

480
00:21:50,430 --> 00:21:52,560
You truly intend
to support our retreat

481
00:21:52,600 --> 00:21:53,900
and aid our captain?

482
00:21:54,520 --> 00:21:57,730
Hey, Dotta.
The mission isn't over yet.

483
00:21:57,780 --> 00:22:00,360
[DOTTA] Xylo! Are you serious?

484
00:22:00,570 --> 00:22:02,360
I'm afraid I am.

485
00:22:02,610 --> 00:22:04,700
We'll meet up
with the Holy Knights

486
00:22:04,740 --> 00:22:07,080
and prevent them
from being routed.

487
00:22:07,200 --> 00:22:08,370
[Dotta groans]

488
00:22:08,410 --> 00:22:11,080
My knight
is the very epitome of honor!

489
00:22:11,160 --> 00:22:14,040
I vote against it.
Can we talk about this?

490
00:22:14,080 --> 00:22:17,130
I know you wouldn't wanna die
for those Holy Knights, either.

491
00:22:17,170 --> 00:22:18,800
Especially since you said you--

492
00:22:18,840 --> 00:22:20,130
Are you done?

493
00:22:21,510 --> 00:22:23,630
If the choice was mine to make,

494
00:22:23,680 --> 00:22:26,550
I'd gladly
let those bastards die.

495
00:22:26,600 --> 00:22:29,270
I despise people
who throw their lives away.

496
00:22:29,310 --> 00:22:30,720
But I can't.

497
00:22:31,100 --> 00:22:33,190
If I let them die on my watch,

498
00:22:33,230 --> 00:22:35,310
they'll have cause
to look down on me,

499
00:22:35,350 --> 00:22:37,730
and that's one thing
I can't allow.

500
00:22:38,150 --> 00:22:39,690
Interesting logic.

501
00:22:39,980 --> 00:22:41,240
[XYLO] Let's go.

502
00:22:41,780 --> 00:22:44,490
If the Holy Knights
get slaughtered out there,

503
00:22:44,530 --> 00:22:46,660
we'll pay a steep price.

504
00:22:56,210 --> 00:22:57,960
[water splashes]

505
00:23:00,300 --> 00:23:02,260
[background chatter]

506
00:23:05,050 --> 00:23:07,390
[MAN 1] Get some nourishment
while you can.

507
00:23:08,350 --> 00:23:09,760
[gulping]

508
00:23:14,850 --> 00:23:16,350
[gasps]

509
00:23:16,390 --> 00:23:17,690
Enemy sighted!

510
00:23:17,730 --> 00:23:19,860
Form ranks now!

511
00:23:19,900 --> 00:23:21,320
[monster growls]

512
00:23:24,200 --> 00:23:26,450
Thunder staff squad, advance!

513
00:23:26,490 --> 00:23:28,570
[♪ tense music playing]

514
00:23:35,160 --> 00:23:37,330
[♪ dramatic music playing]

515
00:23:40,090 --> 00:23:41,710
[WOMAN] Prepare yourselves.

516
00:23:43,760 --> 00:23:46,420
We will hold
until the last moment!

517
00:23:50,550 --> 00:23:52,010
[knight pants]

518
00:24:02,520 --> 00:24:04,150
Fire!

519
00:24:14,330 --> 00:24:15,830
The first wave is down!

520
00:24:16,120 --> 00:24:18,210
But still,
there are way too many!

521
00:24:18,920 --> 00:24:20,630
They have trolls!

522
00:24:22,210 --> 00:24:23,670
[roars]

523
00:24:26,260 --> 00:24:28,130
Use the thunder ballistae.

524
00:24:28,300 --> 00:24:30,470
We cannot allow them
to cross the river!

525
00:24:34,350 --> 00:24:35,430
[metal thuds]

526
00:24:35,470 --> 00:24:37,060
[KNIGHT] Fire.

527
00:24:37,100 --> 00:24:38,640
[energy swishes]

528
00:24:39,600 --> 00:24:41,520
[charging buzz]

529
00:24:46,780 --> 00:24:48,820
[growls]

530
00:24:54,490 --> 00:24:56,290
[DOTTA]
They're in the thick of it.

531
00:24:56,330 --> 00:24:58,830
The Verkle Development
Corporation's assault team.

532
00:24:58,870 --> 00:25:00,420
They're strong, but won't have

533
00:25:00,460 --> 00:25:02,580
nearly enough ammunition
to pull this off.

534
00:25:02,670 --> 00:25:05,840
Xylo. Do you recognize
any of those knights?

535
00:25:07,010 --> 00:25:08,050
[XYLO] I don't,

536
00:25:08,340 --> 00:25:10,720
and I've never seen
that banner before.

537
00:25:10,800 --> 00:25:12,390
Then let's stay where we are.

538
00:25:12,430 --> 00:25:14,890
There's still a chance
they can tough it out.

539
00:25:14,930 --> 00:25:17,100
[TEORITTA]
Utter nonsense from Craven Lips.

540
00:25:17,770 --> 00:25:20,060
Does not your timid heart
crave glory?

541
00:25:20,100 --> 00:25:22,560
Nor wish to share
in its sweet nectar?

542
00:25:23,940 --> 00:25:25,320
Doesn't matter.

543
00:25:25,360 --> 00:25:27,900
They would never let us share
in their glory.

544
00:25:29,240 --> 00:25:30,780
[KNIGHT] Out of ammo!

545
00:25:30,990 --> 00:25:33,320
Captain,
the ballista isn't working.

546
00:25:33,490 --> 00:25:36,080
We'll have to revert
to standard weaponry.

547
00:25:36,120 --> 00:25:38,620
Use pikes to block
whatever's still moving!

548
00:25:38,870 --> 00:25:40,160
[knight grunts]

549
00:25:40,250 --> 00:25:41,830
[knights scream]

550
00:25:41,870 --> 00:25:43,880
[screams, grunts]

551
00:25:55,180 --> 00:25:57,930
The faeries will likely
send another unit around back

552
00:25:57,970 --> 00:25:59,020
to flank them.

553
00:25:59,060 --> 00:26:00,680
The demon lord
who's leading them

554
00:26:00,730 --> 00:26:03,650
is thinking strategically.
And that's the smart move.

555
00:26:03,850 --> 00:26:07,480
We should meet up with them
and devise a plan of att--

556
00:26:09,990 --> 00:26:12,030
Are you kidding me?

557
00:26:12,110 --> 00:26:13,700
Huh? He's gone.

558
00:26:13,740 --> 00:26:15,200
Guess I should have known.

559
00:26:15,240 --> 00:26:16,370
[Teoritta exhales]

560
00:26:21,540 --> 00:26:23,460
Did you misplace
your loyal squire?

561
00:26:23,500 --> 00:26:25,960
So it seems. And now,
he's proven he's nothing

562
00:26:26,000 --> 00:26:28,750
but a piece of garbage
who should never be trusted.

563
00:26:28,800 --> 00:26:30,300
I'll make him pay in blood.

564
00:26:30,420 --> 00:26:32,630
You finally see
that I am the only one worthy

565
00:26:32,670 --> 00:26:33,720
of your trust!

566
00:26:33,760 --> 00:26:35,970
You require a miracle,
do you not?

567
00:26:36,010 --> 00:26:38,850
I already told you.
I won't ask a goddess.

568
00:26:38,890 --> 00:26:40,770
[distant explosions]

569
00:26:43,730 --> 00:26:44,850
[XYLO] Shit!

570
00:26:45,060 --> 00:26:48,400
Hope my flight seal
is fast enough!

571
00:26:48,440 --> 00:26:50,190
[♪ tense music playing]

572
00:26:54,700 --> 00:26:56,160
[clicks tongue]

573
00:26:59,870 --> 00:27:01,950
[people screaming]

574
00:27:02,830 --> 00:27:04,290
Take this!

575
00:27:06,960 --> 00:27:08,920
Again!

576
00:27:08,960 --> 00:27:10,920
[♪ dramatic music playing]

577
00:27:15,430 --> 00:27:16,550
[knife clinks]

578
00:27:17,220 --> 00:27:18,350
[grunts]

579
00:27:21,640 --> 00:27:23,680
[knights grunt]

580
00:27:27,270 --> 00:27:29,230
[monsters shriek]

581
00:27:33,150 --> 00:27:34,650
[KNIGHT] Draw!

582
00:27:34,950 --> 00:27:36,910
Loose your arrows!

583
00:27:42,120 --> 00:27:43,700
[all gasp]

584
00:27:44,410 --> 00:27:46,750
[knights scream]

585
00:27:48,420 --> 00:27:49,790
[monsters shriek]

586
00:27:50,460 --> 00:27:52,050
[people screaming]

587
00:27:55,300 --> 00:27:56,470
[Xylo grunts]

588
00:28:01,010 --> 00:28:02,560
[woman grunts]

589
00:28:04,060 --> 00:28:05,560
[WOMAN] What is that?

590
00:28:05,810 --> 00:28:08,020
Is that everything you've got?

591
00:28:08,480 --> 00:28:10,400
Because if that's the case,

592
00:28:10,480 --> 00:28:12,650
this win's too damn easy!

593
00:28:13,230 --> 00:28:16,400
[XYLO] Die, die, die, die!

594
00:28:16,450 --> 00:28:18,450
Just die!

595
00:28:21,240 --> 00:28:22,490
[grunts]

596
00:28:24,830 --> 00:28:26,540
[Xylo pants]

597
00:28:38,880 --> 00:28:40,180
[spits]

598
00:28:47,270 --> 00:28:48,520
[horse neighs]

599
00:28:50,230 --> 00:28:51,480
Who are you?

600
00:28:51,560 --> 00:28:54,150
I'm guessing you're none other
than Captain Kivia.

601
00:28:54,190 --> 00:28:55,480
My knight!

602
00:28:56,240 --> 00:28:58,530
Why would you go
and leave me behind?

603
00:28:58,570 --> 00:29:00,820
My goddess?
What are you doing out here?

604
00:29:00,860 --> 00:29:02,870
We sent you off safely
to Galtuile!

605
00:29:02,910 --> 00:29:04,410
[XYLO] Calm yourself.

606
00:29:04,450 --> 00:29:06,540
[KIVIA] You.
Did you attack the transport?

607
00:29:06,580 --> 00:29:09,500
Why ever would I?
They're unharmed.

608
00:29:09,870 --> 00:29:12,710
[XYLO] None of this mess
is remotely my fault.

609
00:29:12,750 --> 00:29:13,840
In any case...

610
00:29:13,880 --> 00:29:14,920
[Teoritta gasps]

611
00:29:14,960 --> 00:29:17,260
I haven't made a pact yet.

612
00:29:18,130 --> 00:29:20,970
Speak, my knight.
What is the meaning of this?

613
00:29:21,010 --> 00:29:22,260
I told you,

614
00:29:22,300 --> 00:29:25,140
there's nothing I hate more
than a goddess.

615
00:29:26,640 --> 00:29:30,520
[XYLO] I'm not your knight.
Find someone else to cling to.

616
00:29:30,600 --> 00:29:31,940
[Teoritta sighs]

617
00:29:34,020 --> 00:29:35,150
[Kivia gasps]

618
00:29:35,610 --> 00:29:37,030
Explain yourself.

619
00:29:37,070 --> 00:29:39,700
Who exactly are you
and what are you doing here?

620
00:29:39,860 --> 00:29:42,320
While I'd love
to give you the rundown,

621
00:29:42,360 --> 00:29:45,030
not now.
There's no time to waste.

622
00:29:45,080 --> 00:29:46,370
[Kivia gasps]

623
00:29:48,120 --> 00:29:49,960
[XYLO] The demon lord.

624
00:29:51,580 --> 00:29:53,380
[♪ tense music playing]

625
00:29:58,590 --> 00:30:00,550
[grunts, growls]

626
00:30:01,720 --> 00:30:03,260
[birds caw]

627
00:30:05,180 --> 00:30:06,600
[shrieks]

628
00:30:11,980 --> 00:30:14,400
Seems it caught up to you.

629
00:30:14,440 --> 00:30:16,190
Number 47.

630
00:30:16,480 --> 00:30:18,440
There's no mistaking it.

631
00:30:19,650 --> 00:30:21,700
Awd Goggie.

632
00:30:22,490 --> 00:30:24,110
[grunts, shrieks]

633
00:30:27,080 --> 00:30:28,870
[wind blows]

634
00:30:37,960 --> 00:30:39,510
[♪ tense music playing]

635
00:30:39,590 --> 00:30:41,090
[monster shrieks]

636
00:30:41,800 --> 00:30:43,220
[growls]

637
00:30:47,510 --> 00:30:48,600
[gasps]

638
00:30:48,640 --> 00:30:49,680
Incoming!

639
00:30:49,720 --> 00:30:51,680
Don't let that thing
break through!

640
00:30:51,730 --> 00:30:53,560
[charging buzz]

641
00:30:55,230 --> 00:30:57,440
Wait! Hold your fire!

642
00:31:07,870 --> 00:31:09,700
[energy buzzes]

643
00:31:15,920 --> 00:31:17,960
[knights yell in terror]

644
00:31:25,630 --> 00:31:28,260
[XYLO] Shit!
It erected a force field.

645
00:31:28,300 --> 00:31:31,560
Now it can repel all the blasts.
It's a real tricky one.

646
00:31:31,600 --> 00:31:33,890
We're gonna have
to get up close to fight it.

647
00:31:34,140 --> 00:31:36,400
Don't you have
any battering rams or slings?

648
00:31:36,440 --> 00:31:38,980
They're still preparing them
in the First Capital.

649
00:31:39,020 --> 00:31:41,690
We'll have to hope
our scorched earth seals work.

650
00:31:41,780 --> 00:31:43,990
-[KIVIA] Engineers--
-[XYLO] Don't do it.

651
00:31:44,070 --> 00:31:46,070
You'll destroy
everything in sight,

652
00:31:46,110 --> 00:31:49,620
including the seal users
and every last one of us!

653
00:31:50,620 --> 00:31:52,080
[energy buzzes]

654
00:31:54,290 --> 00:31:55,870
[monsters growl]

655
00:32:00,670 --> 00:32:02,670
It's suicide to mount a defense!

656
00:32:02,710 --> 00:32:04,800
We should fall back
and head east.

657
00:32:09,260 --> 00:32:12,600
[KIVIA]
I will not waver. We fight!

658
00:32:12,640 --> 00:32:13,680
[gasps]

659
00:32:13,720 --> 00:32:15,100
Don't be foolish!

660
00:32:15,140 --> 00:32:17,980
Our only mission here
is to support your retreat!

661
00:32:19,270 --> 00:32:20,980
Is that what you're doing?

662
00:32:21,190 --> 00:32:22,230
[gasps]

663
00:32:22,270 --> 00:32:24,070
Are you a hero?

664
00:32:24,110 --> 00:32:26,490
I am. That a problem?

665
00:32:27,150 --> 00:32:30,450
High Command in Galtuile
has granted captains like me

666
00:32:30,490 --> 00:32:32,200
the right
to make the final call!

667
00:32:32,330 --> 00:32:34,580
As such,
I will lay down my very life

668
00:32:34,620 --> 00:32:35,660
in pursuit of honor!

669
00:32:35,700 --> 00:32:37,830
I don't care
about your damn honor!

670
00:32:37,870 --> 00:32:39,750
Honor is all that matters!

671
00:32:39,790 --> 00:32:40,880
[groans]

672
00:32:40,920 --> 00:32:42,500
[XYLO] I've heard enough.

673
00:32:42,540 --> 00:32:45,460
I don't know what's driving you
to do this, but don't you care

674
00:32:45,510 --> 00:32:47,590
that you're dragging us down
with you?

675
00:32:47,630 --> 00:32:50,090
Why should I care
about the life of a hero?

676
00:32:50,140 --> 00:32:52,970
You're scum. Too low
for even death's release.

677
00:32:53,010 --> 00:32:56,810
As for her, explain at once
why you have the goddess!

678
00:32:56,850 --> 00:32:58,640
He's my knight.

679
00:32:58,730 --> 00:33:00,730
Xylo guides my way.

680
00:33:02,110 --> 00:33:03,900
[KIVIA]
I ordered for the goddess

681
00:33:03,940 --> 00:33:06,980
to be sent to Galtuile,
knowing we would die here.

682
00:33:07,030 --> 00:33:09,780
To see that critical mission
through to the end!

683
00:33:09,860 --> 00:33:11,320
Yet now...

684
00:33:11,360 --> 00:33:12,830
[gasps]

685
00:33:12,870 --> 00:33:14,450
Hold on.

686
00:33:14,490 --> 00:33:16,120
You're Xylo?

687
00:33:16,330 --> 00:33:17,450
[gasps]

688
00:33:22,040 --> 00:33:23,290
It's here.

689
00:33:27,760 --> 00:33:30,010
-[Xylo gasps]
-[monster shrieks]

690
00:33:30,840 --> 00:33:33,010
[XYLO] This cannot be real.

691
00:33:35,180 --> 00:33:38,020
[♪ eerie music playing]

692
00:33:43,610 --> 00:33:44,820
Heads up!

693
00:33:44,860 --> 00:33:46,270
[people screaming]

694
00:33:51,320 --> 00:33:53,320
I need damage reports!

695
00:33:54,870 --> 00:33:56,620
Xylo! There!

696
00:33:57,290 --> 00:33:58,790
[monsters shriek]

697
00:33:59,040 --> 00:34:00,250
[people screaming]

698
00:34:00,290 --> 00:34:02,370
[KNIGHT 1]
What the hell are those things?

699
00:34:03,250 --> 00:34:04,880
[KNIGHT 2] No! Stay back!

700
00:34:06,130 --> 00:34:07,800
[man screaming]

701
00:34:10,130 --> 00:34:12,260
[people screaming
and grunting]

702
00:34:12,380 --> 00:34:13,890
It's a massacre!

703
00:34:17,510 --> 00:34:18,930
[monster growls]

704
00:34:20,770 --> 00:34:22,730
[people screaming]

705
00:34:24,560 --> 00:34:26,610
[growling, screaming]

706
00:34:30,690 --> 00:34:32,610
At any cost, hold!

707
00:34:32,650 --> 00:34:36,580
[KNIGHT 1] Dammit!
We can't take much more!

708
00:34:36,620 --> 00:34:38,240
-[Xylo grunts]
-[knife clinks]

709
00:34:39,040 --> 00:34:40,330
[explosion]

710
00:34:43,250 --> 00:34:45,040
Still two left.

711
00:34:46,750 --> 00:34:48,590
You need not worry!

712
00:34:49,090 --> 00:34:50,300
[monster roars]

713
00:34:50,340 --> 00:34:51,420
[grunts]

714
00:34:54,970 --> 00:34:56,300
[Xylo yells fiercely]

715
00:35:00,220 --> 00:35:01,600
[grunts]

716
00:35:01,770 --> 00:35:03,390
[monster growls]

717
00:35:07,440 --> 00:35:10,070
-Our luck ran out.
-What are you doing?

718
00:35:10,150 --> 00:35:11,610
[people screaming]

719
00:35:15,360 --> 00:35:17,410
[♪ dramatic music playing]

720
00:35:23,250 --> 00:35:24,540
[man screaming]

721
00:35:24,580 --> 00:35:26,120
[Xylo pants and grunts]

722
00:35:34,800 --> 00:35:36,550
[TEORITTA] My knight...

723
00:35:37,680 --> 00:35:40,890
you must rise.

724
00:35:42,180 --> 00:35:44,230
[grunts]

725
00:35:45,390 --> 00:35:47,140
The time has come

726
00:35:47,310 --> 00:35:50,110
for you to awaken my power.

727
00:35:54,570 --> 00:35:56,400
Should you refuse,

728
00:35:56,450 --> 00:36:00,740
every soul present
shall die a tragic death.

729
00:36:00,780 --> 00:36:02,080
[Xylo grunts]

730
00:36:02,620 --> 00:36:05,040
[XYLO] I guess we're screwed.

731
00:36:05,080 --> 00:36:07,160
I would rather die

732
00:36:07,460 --> 00:36:10,250
than ever trust a goddess again.

733
00:36:10,710 --> 00:36:12,210
[grunts]

734
00:36:14,800 --> 00:36:19,930
Kivia! Come claim your goddess!
Make the damn pact yourself!

735
00:36:21,600 --> 00:36:23,810
[XYLO] Kivia! Answer me!

736
00:36:23,850 --> 00:36:25,600
[♪ dramatic music playing]

737
00:36:25,850 --> 00:36:27,600
[people screaming]

738
00:36:33,110 --> 00:36:34,860
[panting]

739
00:36:35,030 --> 00:36:36,150
[metal thuds]

740
00:36:36,950 --> 00:36:38,030
[gasps]

741
00:36:38,240 --> 00:36:40,160
[screaming in terror]

742
00:36:42,950 --> 00:36:44,040
[grunts]

743
00:36:45,290 --> 00:36:46,540
[grunts]

744
00:36:46,710 --> 00:36:49,370
[Xylo pants]

745
00:36:49,420 --> 00:36:51,040
-[TEORITTA] Xylo.
-[Xylo gasps]

746
00:36:53,960 --> 00:36:56,300
[TEORITTA]
You are my chosen knight.

747
00:36:56,460 --> 00:36:57,720
Unless you act,

748
00:36:57,760 --> 00:37:00,890
many more precious lives
shall be lost.

749
00:37:02,800 --> 00:37:05,260
Do you find that acceptable?

750
00:37:06,770 --> 00:37:08,140
[XYLO] Be quiet.

751
00:37:08,430 --> 00:37:10,230
I'm trying to think.

752
00:37:12,610 --> 00:37:14,190
[TEORITTA] All is well.

753
00:37:14,770 --> 00:37:17,860
You may despise me
if your heart insists.

754
00:37:17,900 --> 00:37:21,360
And wish ill upon all goddesses.

755
00:37:21,410 --> 00:37:25,410
For it matters not!
Victory shall still be yours.

756
00:37:29,750 --> 00:37:31,790
[♪ dramatic music playing]

757
00:37:33,590 --> 00:37:35,420
[XYLO] Piece of shit!

758
00:37:36,760 --> 00:37:37,880
Do it!

759
00:37:37,920 --> 00:37:40,010
There's no other way
out of this.

760
00:37:41,220 --> 00:37:42,680
It shall be done.

761
00:37:42,890 --> 00:37:45,930
But first, such a divine pact
requires an offering.

762
00:37:46,010 --> 00:37:47,180
[grunts]

763
00:37:49,600 --> 00:37:51,440
[TEORITTA]
The price to be paid is--

764
00:37:51,480 --> 00:37:52,650
I'm aware.

765
00:37:56,650 --> 00:37:58,360
Did I guess right?

766
00:37:59,820 --> 00:38:03,160
Teoritta. Help me win.

767
00:38:03,200 --> 00:38:05,990
Xylo. Swear, now and forever,

768
00:38:06,030 --> 00:38:08,910
to exemplify the majesty
befitting my knight.

769
00:38:08,950 --> 00:38:11,000
[XYLO] I swear.
Just get on with it.

770
00:38:11,040 --> 00:38:12,420
Very well.

771
00:38:12,460 --> 00:38:13,830
Now, my knight.

772
00:38:13,880 --> 00:38:16,880
Rejoice! I grant you
the power of a goddess.

773
00:38:19,590 --> 00:38:21,550
[♪ dramatic music intensifies]

774
00:38:24,720 --> 00:38:26,890
And... there I go.

775
00:38:28,600 --> 00:38:29,850
[XYLO] Once again,

776
00:38:29,890 --> 00:38:32,350
I'm choosing
to throw my life away.

777
00:38:33,390 --> 00:38:34,520
[grunts]

778
00:38:35,730 --> 00:38:37,690
[TEORITTA]
The pact has been made.

779
00:38:37,730 --> 00:38:40,780
The veil of your mind
has been lifted for me.

780
00:38:42,780 --> 00:38:45,910
What manner of blessing
shall you request of me?

781
00:38:49,040 --> 00:38:52,040
[XYLO] That. And make it flashy.

782
00:38:52,710 --> 00:38:54,540
Time to drive them back.

783
00:38:55,040 --> 00:38:56,960
[TEORITTA] A valiant standoff.

784
00:38:57,000 --> 00:38:59,170
Your resolve is laudable.

785
00:38:59,670 --> 00:39:01,170
So be it.

786
00:39:01,300 --> 00:39:02,920
By the grace of my power,

787
00:39:03,010 --> 00:39:05,800
I shall gladly
offer you my blessing!

788
00:39:09,310 --> 00:39:10,930
Kneel down!

789
00:39:11,180 --> 00:39:14,690
Pray to the goddess of swords,
Teoritta!

790
00:39:14,770 --> 00:39:16,730
[♪ adventurous music playing]

791
00:39:25,820 --> 00:39:27,240
[monsters growl]

792
00:39:35,120 --> 00:39:36,370
[gasps]

793
00:39:41,920 --> 00:39:43,590
[indistinct chatter]

794
00:39:45,050 --> 00:39:47,090
I trust that was satisfactory.

795
00:39:47,220 --> 00:39:50,350
And now I give you permission
to praise my sublime power

796
00:39:50,390 --> 00:39:52,470
and worship me
as much as you please!

797
00:39:52,850 --> 00:39:54,180
[Xylo growls]

798
00:39:54,270 --> 00:39:56,730
[TEORITTA] Do you hear?
I've granted you permission.

799
00:39:56,770 --> 00:39:59,150
-Now, pat my head.
-[XYLO] Sorry.

800
00:39:59,900 --> 00:40:01,730
The mission comes first.

801
00:40:06,700 --> 00:40:09,570
And that means killing
every last one of them!

802
00:40:10,830 --> 00:40:12,290
[monster roars]

803
00:40:12,450 --> 00:40:14,580
[yells fiercely]

804
00:40:16,790 --> 00:40:17,870
[monster growling]

805
00:40:18,420 --> 00:40:20,630
-Keep them coming!
-[TEORITTA] With ease.

806
00:40:20,670 --> 00:40:23,300
Though I expect ample praise
when the deed is done.

807
00:40:23,340 --> 00:40:25,800
You'll have it
if we survive this!

808
00:40:28,050 --> 00:40:29,550
Here we go!

809
00:40:30,600 --> 00:40:32,010
[XYLO] Keep it up!

810
00:40:33,390 --> 00:40:35,640
More, more, more!

811
00:40:35,680 --> 00:40:37,190
Don't stop!

812
00:40:37,690 --> 00:40:39,770
[KIVIA] What's... happening?

813
00:40:39,940 --> 00:40:41,020
[Xylo scoffs]

814
00:40:41,060 --> 00:40:42,320
[XYLO] Still alive?

815
00:40:43,190 --> 00:40:46,110
Kivia! Once you've cleared out
the last of them,

816
00:40:46,150 --> 00:40:47,820
get the wounded to safety.

817
00:40:47,860 --> 00:40:50,070
You expect me
to follow your command?

818
00:40:50,120 --> 00:40:51,240
A disgusting hero who--

819
00:40:51,280 --> 00:40:53,620
It is your only hope
of survival!

820
00:40:53,660 --> 00:40:54,740
[gasps]

821
00:40:56,200 --> 00:40:58,420
[XYLO]
I don't intend to die here.

822
00:40:58,460 --> 00:41:01,210
Or care to watch you
and your knights perish.

823
00:41:01,710 --> 00:41:03,040
Meaning...

824
00:41:04,960 --> 00:41:07,420
I will kill the demon lord.

825
00:41:07,460 --> 00:41:08,630
[gasps]

826
00:41:08,720 --> 00:41:10,430
[XYLO] If we make it out alive,

827
00:41:10,970 --> 00:41:13,970
I'll accept any punishment
that you deem fit

828
00:41:14,010 --> 00:41:16,060
and answer all your questions.

829
00:41:16,600 --> 00:41:18,890
[TEORITTA] Xylo,
have you chosen at last

830
00:41:19,060 --> 00:41:20,650
to fight for honor's sake?

831
00:41:21,190 --> 00:41:24,110
You and those feckless knights
just won't stop going on

832
00:41:24,150 --> 00:41:25,780
about that crap, will you?

833
00:41:26,150 --> 00:41:28,360
Fighting for honor's sake.

834
00:41:28,860 --> 00:41:30,740
That's a fool's game!

835
00:41:30,820 --> 00:41:32,320
[swords clink]

836
00:41:32,490 --> 00:41:33,950
[gasps]

837
00:41:34,870 --> 00:41:36,370
[XYLO] My motive

838
00:41:37,120 --> 00:41:41,040
is my desire to inflict
unfathomable violence.

839
00:41:41,080 --> 00:41:42,960
Let's get on with it!

840
00:41:44,840 --> 00:41:46,920
[♪ tense music playing]

841
00:41:51,430 --> 00:41:54,180
-Don't let go.
-Presumptuous.

842
00:41:54,600 --> 00:41:58,220
It is my place to worry
about you fallible humans.

843
00:41:58,270 --> 00:42:00,060
[roars]

844
00:42:03,980 --> 00:42:06,860
[TEORITTA] Now, my knight,
shall I bestow my blessing?

845
00:42:06,900 --> 00:42:09,320
No, I'll say when!

846
00:42:16,080 --> 00:42:19,750
Why delay?
Do you dare underestimate me?

847
00:42:20,000 --> 00:42:22,870
Even a goddess
such as you has a limit.

848
00:42:22,920 --> 00:42:26,130
When you exhaust yourself,
your flames grow brighter.

849
00:42:26,210 --> 00:42:27,420
Perhaps.

850
00:42:28,130 --> 00:42:30,220
[XYLO] I forbid you
to die out there.

851
00:42:30,260 --> 00:42:32,510
You won't get a word of praise
for that.

852
00:42:32,550 --> 00:42:33,630
[Teoritta sighs]

853
00:42:33,890 --> 00:42:35,180
After all,

854
00:42:35,260 --> 00:42:37,430
a goddess
should leave the strategizing

855
00:42:37,470 --> 00:42:38,890
to her faithful knight!

856
00:42:38,930 --> 00:42:40,100
[roaring]

857
00:42:44,900 --> 00:42:48,230
[XYLO] I can do it.
I'll forge a path for us!

858
00:42:52,450 --> 00:42:54,110
[monster roars]

859
00:42:55,780 --> 00:42:57,490
That was most impressive.

860
00:42:57,530 --> 00:42:59,040
Now, it is my turn!

861
00:42:59,080 --> 00:43:00,620
Not yet!

862
00:43:00,660 --> 00:43:01,910
[fighting grunts]

863
00:43:03,660 --> 00:43:04,960
Xylo!

864
00:43:06,000 --> 00:43:07,750
[roars]

865
00:43:08,290 --> 00:43:10,760
Get ready!
We're cutting through!

866
00:43:16,090 --> 00:43:17,220
[Xylo grunts]

867
00:43:17,510 --> 00:43:19,680
My patience is waning!

868
00:43:19,720 --> 00:43:21,520
[XYLO] I said no!

869
00:43:27,150 --> 00:43:29,320
That's a demon lord?

870
00:43:30,150 --> 00:43:32,610
Naturally,
I'm above feelings of fear.

871
00:43:32,650 --> 00:43:35,200
Goddesses were created
to strike down demon lords.

872
00:43:35,240 --> 00:43:37,370
-Allow me to demonstrate.
-Almost.

873
00:43:37,660 --> 00:43:39,660
[XYLO] Just a bit longer.

874
00:43:41,200 --> 00:43:42,700
[monster shrieks]

875
00:43:46,080 --> 00:43:47,380
[Xylo yells fiercely]

876
00:43:50,040 --> 00:43:51,800
[♪ adventurous music playing]

877
00:43:51,840 --> 00:43:53,010
[groans]

878
00:44:00,140 --> 00:44:02,010
[yells]

879
00:44:09,810 --> 00:44:11,360
[shrieks]

880
00:44:12,860 --> 00:44:13,990
[scoffs]

881
00:44:14,150 --> 00:44:16,900
That's a lot of howling
over one measly leg!

882
00:44:19,450 --> 00:44:20,780
[shrieks]

883
00:44:23,500 --> 00:44:25,120
Come at me!

884
00:44:28,370 --> 00:44:30,790
Xylo.
We shall soon be surrounded!

885
00:44:30,960 --> 00:44:32,630
Allow me to help you now.

886
00:44:32,670 --> 00:44:35,260
Do it! Clear a path for me!

887
00:44:35,300 --> 00:44:37,430
Give it all you've got!

888
00:44:37,550 --> 00:44:41,140
[TEORITTA] It shall be done.
Behold my glory!

889
00:44:41,180 --> 00:44:42,970
[growls]

890
00:44:51,560 --> 00:44:53,360
-Next--
-Spare your words.

891
00:44:53,400 --> 00:44:55,690
Your mind is like an open book,
my knight.

892
00:44:55,820 --> 00:44:56,990
Can you?

893
00:44:58,950 --> 00:45:00,200
Yes!

894
00:45:00,780 --> 00:45:03,080
I am a goddess, am I not?

895
00:45:03,370 --> 00:45:06,700
Now pray to me, with devotion!

896
00:45:11,960 --> 00:45:13,250
[XYLO] Perfect.

897
00:45:15,880 --> 00:45:19,050
That is exactly
what I was praying for!

898
00:45:22,260 --> 00:45:23,760
[fast blow]

899
00:45:25,100 --> 00:45:26,640
To hell with you,

900
00:45:26,770 --> 00:45:29,890
you damn cockroach!

901
00:45:36,190 --> 00:45:38,110
[monster groans]

902
00:45:43,200 --> 00:45:44,950
[Xylo grunts]

903
00:45:49,870 --> 00:45:51,580
[groans]

904
00:45:54,210 --> 00:45:55,790
See, my knight?

905
00:45:55,840 --> 00:45:57,920
I did. Now let's--

906
00:45:59,760 --> 00:46:01,300
[shrieks]

907
00:46:02,510 --> 00:46:03,840
Teoritta!

908
00:46:04,350 --> 00:46:05,760
[thud]

909
00:46:07,220 --> 00:46:09,680
[TEORITTA] Xylo! Xylo!

910
00:46:10,100 --> 00:46:11,350
Xylo!

911
00:46:12,060 --> 00:46:13,230
Xylo!

912
00:46:13,730 --> 00:46:14,940
[groans]

913
00:46:16,190 --> 00:46:17,980
[TEORITTA]
You're gravely injured,

914
00:46:18,030 --> 00:46:19,990
and all because
you were protecting me!

915
00:46:20,070 --> 00:46:21,200
[gasps]

916
00:46:25,450 --> 00:46:27,030
[monsters growl]

917
00:46:28,870 --> 00:46:30,870
My knight! Do you live?

918
00:46:30,910 --> 00:46:32,370
You will stay with me!

919
00:46:32,420 --> 00:46:34,580
[DOTTA] Uh... Xylo?

920
00:46:35,460 --> 00:46:37,710
Huh?

921
00:46:37,750 --> 00:46:40,340
What are you doing
in the middle of all this?

922
00:46:42,170 --> 00:46:43,300
[gasps]

923
00:46:46,010 --> 00:46:48,140
[XYLO] A scorched earth seal.

924
00:46:48,640 --> 00:46:50,600
[coughs]

925
00:46:51,730 --> 00:46:53,270
You punk!

926
00:46:53,520 --> 00:46:54,650
[Dotta grunts]

927
00:46:55,020 --> 00:46:57,270
You're out stealing again!

928
00:46:57,320 --> 00:46:59,150
Whoa, whoa,
it's not what you think!

929
00:46:59,190 --> 00:47:03,110
I, uh. went to the camp,
and it was lying there, so...

930
00:47:03,450 --> 00:47:04,950
You're lucky this time.

931
00:47:04,990 --> 00:47:06,910
I'd rather thank you
than kill you.

932
00:47:07,120 --> 00:47:09,160
[♪ adventurous music playing]

933
00:47:12,080 --> 00:47:13,460
And... what are you doing?

934
00:47:13,500 --> 00:47:15,790
Look at the dial
in the shape of the grooves.

935
00:47:15,830 --> 00:47:17,790
They let you choose
how it blows.

936
00:47:18,420 --> 00:47:21,340
I'm just glad
it's a model I recognize.

937
00:47:21,380 --> 00:47:23,220
Great. So what's next?

938
00:47:23,260 --> 00:47:26,300
Gonna give the big guy
more than he bargained for!

939
00:47:28,850 --> 00:47:32,060
Let's see how well
you deal with this one!

940
00:47:33,980 --> 00:47:35,440
-Did you--
-We're off!

941
00:47:35,480 --> 00:47:36,900
[Dotta and Teoritta grunt]

942
00:47:38,900 --> 00:47:40,650
[charging buzz]

943
00:48:02,880 --> 00:48:04,760
[birds chirping]

944
00:48:17,650 --> 00:48:19,150
How in the... ?

945
00:48:19,770 --> 00:48:21,110
Is it over?

946
00:48:23,070 --> 00:48:25,240
[TEORITTA] The faerie forces
are withdrawing.

947
00:48:25,280 --> 00:48:28,410
[XYLO] That always happens
as the Demon Blight fades.

948
00:48:28,450 --> 00:48:31,120
I've beaten enough demon lords
to know.

949
00:48:31,490 --> 00:48:33,450
I'd say
that's gotta be the dumbest way

950
00:48:33,490 --> 00:48:35,200
I ever made it happen, though.

951
00:48:35,250 --> 00:48:38,170
Dotta. I'll hand it to him
and his sticky fingers

952
00:48:38,210 --> 00:48:39,330
for saving the day.

953
00:48:39,380 --> 00:48:41,340
I'll buy him a drink
when he wakes up.

954
00:48:41,380 --> 00:48:42,670
[TEORITTA] My knight.

955
00:48:44,090 --> 00:48:47,550
You were brilliant!
A fierce and fearsome combatant.

956
00:48:47,590 --> 00:48:49,840
The day is ours.
A victory achieved

957
00:48:49,890 --> 00:48:52,260
through the grace of the goddess
at your side.

958
00:48:52,470 --> 00:48:55,560
Surely you must feel satisfied
by my abilities!

959
00:48:58,060 --> 00:48:59,400
[XYLO] I guess.

960
00:48:59,560 --> 00:49:01,650
[TEORITTA] Well, then.
[clears throat]

961
00:49:02,980 --> 00:49:04,190
[sighs]

962
00:49:06,150 --> 00:49:07,610
In that case,

963
00:49:07,650 --> 00:49:10,240
is it not fitting to praise
one who has done so well?

964
00:49:11,120 --> 00:49:12,450
Very well.

965
00:49:13,200 --> 00:49:14,910
Good job surviving.

966
00:49:14,950 --> 00:49:17,710
[TEORITTA] I was not expecting
praise of that sort.

967
00:49:17,750 --> 00:49:19,960
Is survival alone truly enough?

968
00:49:21,170 --> 00:49:23,170
[XYLO] It's more than enough.

969
00:49:24,040 --> 00:49:25,460
Take my word.

970
00:49:25,630 --> 00:49:26,960
[gasps]

971
00:49:27,010 --> 00:49:28,220
And yet,

972
00:49:29,010 --> 00:49:32,340
should a goddess
not be held to higher standards?

973
00:49:32,430 --> 00:49:34,930
What? Don't ask me.

974
00:49:34,970 --> 00:49:36,810
I don't get to decide.

975
00:49:37,970 --> 00:49:39,810
I suppose you don't.

976
00:49:41,730 --> 00:49:43,110
Although,

977
00:49:43,150 --> 00:49:45,820
I went above and beyond
mere survival!

978
00:49:45,860 --> 00:49:47,360
I met your expectations

979
00:49:47,400 --> 00:49:49,490
and managed
to slay a demon lord as well!

980
00:49:49,530 --> 00:49:50,990
An accomplishment
I would say

981
00:49:51,030 --> 00:49:52,660
very few could achieve!

982
00:49:53,410 --> 00:49:54,580
Agreed.

983
00:49:54,620 --> 00:49:55,790
[Teoritta chuckles]

984
00:49:55,830 --> 00:49:58,160
Do go on!
You have my leave to praise me

985
00:49:58,200 --> 00:49:59,790
as much as you may desire!

986
00:49:59,830 --> 00:50:02,170
Come now,
there's no need to hold back!

987
00:50:02,210 --> 00:50:04,710
Look,
I am prepared for my laurels!

988
00:50:04,750 --> 00:50:06,300
You may proceed as you see fit!

989
00:50:06,340 --> 00:50:07,380
[laughs]

990
00:50:07,460 --> 00:50:10,090
Go on, my knight!
Show me I did well!

991
00:50:10,130 --> 00:50:12,590
All right. I get it.

992
00:50:22,690 --> 00:50:25,150
[KIVIA] I found you, at last.

993
00:50:25,190 --> 00:50:26,400
I knew it.

994
00:50:26,570 --> 00:50:28,900
You truly are Xylo Forbartz.

995
00:50:29,280 --> 00:50:31,900
This one on the ground
is Dotta Luzulas.

996
00:50:33,610 --> 00:50:34,700
So...

997
00:50:35,070 --> 00:50:37,160
you stole a goddess
in transport,

998
00:50:37,200 --> 00:50:38,830
took a scorched earth seal

999
00:50:38,910 --> 00:50:41,080
and slew a demon lord
outside orders.

1000
00:50:41,120 --> 00:50:44,040
You criminals
are the lowest of the low!

1001
00:50:44,080 --> 00:50:45,130
[Xylo grunts]

1002
00:50:45,170 --> 00:50:46,420
Guess we are.

1003
00:50:46,460 --> 00:50:47,960
Goddess Teoritta.

1004
00:50:48,000 --> 00:50:49,420
You have been deceived.

1005
00:50:49,460 --> 00:50:51,880
We had the Thirteenth Order
of the Holy Knights

1006
00:50:51,920 --> 00:50:54,430
intended to deliver you
to Galtuile Fortress.

1007
00:50:55,010 --> 00:50:58,140
I was certain the transport team
already set out.

1008
00:50:58,930 --> 00:51:00,100
[grunts]

1009
00:51:01,810 --> 00:51:04,480
But this hero
has stolen you from them!

1010
00:51:04,650 --> 00:51:06,980
Then made a pact with you
without permission!

1011
00:51:07,190 --> 00:51:10,400
This Xylo Forbartz,
this man is a villain!

1012
00:51:10,990 --> 00:51:12,280
Is he, now?

1013
00:51:12,610 --> 00:51:15,910
Well then, that's where destiny
has taken me.

1014
00:51:16,030 --> 00:51:17,120
[gasps]

1015
00:51:17,160 --> 00:51:18,700
[TEORITTA] He is my knight.

1016
00:51:19,870 --> 00:51:22,250
And no matter
what you may think,

1017
00:51:22,290 --> 00:51:24,540
I choose to believe in Xylo.

1018
00:51:24,710 --> 00:51:28,920
By his sword,
all demon lords shall be felled.

1019
00:51:29,090 --> 00:51:32,210
He is the knight
who I find worthy of my grace.

1020
00:51:34,590 --> 00:51:36,640
[KIVIA] I beg you to listen.

1021
00:51:36,840 --> 00:51:41,020
You say that if you do not know
the crime he has committed.

1022
00:51:41,220 --> 00:51:42,350
That's true.

1023
00:51:42,390 --> 00:51:44,770
But what crime
could sway my heart?

1024
00:51:45,020 --> 00:51:46,520
He killed a goddess.

1025
00:51:46,560 --> 00:51:47,650
[gasps]

1026
00:51:47,690 --> 00:51:49,940
Look upon a fallen Holy Knight!

1027
00:51:50,230 --> 00:51:52,860
He once made a pact
with a goddess

1028
00:51:53,860 --> 00:51:56,700
and cut her down
with his own hand!

1029
00:52:09,710 --> 00:52:11,300
[indistinct chatter]

1030
00:52:17,760 --> 00:52:19,050
[man clears throat]

1031
00:52:19,140 --> 00:52:21,390
[MAN 1]
Defendant, Xylo Forbartz,

1032
00:52:21,430 --> 00:52:23,350
Captain
of the Federated Kingdoms,

1033
00:52:23,390 --> 00:52:25,560
Fifth Order of the Holy Knights.

1034
00:52:25,600 --> 00:52:28,440
You were seen on the night
before the incident,

1035
00:52:28,480 --> 00:52:30,820
leading your unit
in a supposed path

1036
00:52:30,860 --> 00:52:33,570
meant to intercept
the 11th demon lord.

1037
00:52:33,900 --> 00:52:36,280
Just before dawn,
you entered battle

1038
00:52:36,320 --> 00:52:38,990
alongside
your pacted goddess Senerva.

1039
00:52:39,030 --> 00:52:41,620
Do you have any objection
to these statements?

1040
00:52:43,700 --> 00:52:45,330
They are all true.

1041
00:52:46,160 --> 00:52:47,460
[MAN 2] He's guilty.

1042
00:52:47,500 --> 00:52:48,830
[XYLO] Indeed.

1043
00:52:48,920 --> 00:52:52,960
I did engage in combat
with the 11th demon lord.

1044
00:52:53,000 --> 00:52:54,510
It was brutal.

1045
00:52:54,590 --> 00:52:57,010
I was expecting
reinforcements to arrive,

1046
00:52:57,050 --> 00:52:58,470
but they never showed up.

1047
00:52:58,840 --> 00:53:02,180
[MAN 1] Only answer
the questions you are asked.

1048
00:53:02,850 --> 00:53:06,390
Reports say the defendant
suffered catastrophic losses

1049
00:53:06,430 --> 00:53:08,940
to his unit,
and that he used his goddess

1050
00:53:08,980 --> 00:53:10,560
without leave to do so.

1051
00:53:10,600 --> 00:53:12,360
Do you object to this report?

1052
00:53:12,400 --> 00:53:13,570
I object!

1053
00:53:13,730 --> 00:53:14,860
I was ordered.

1054
00:53:14,900 --> 00:53:16,690
Everything was done
with permission.

1055
00:53:16,740 --> 00:53:18,990
[MAN 1] We've already examined
the records

1056
00:53:19,030 --> 00:53:22,450
from Galtuile Fortress.
There was no such order.

1057
00:53:22,490 --> 00:53:23,870
[XYLO] You're lying.

1058
00:53:24,120 --> 00:53:26,540
We had official orders
to go there.

1059
00:53:26,620 --> 00:53:28,120
The message clearly stated

1060
00:53:28,160 --> 00:53:31,000
that Uthob City
Defense Force Unit 71--

1061
00:53:31,040 --> 00:53:34,130
[MAN 1] No such unit exists
in any of our records.

1062
00:53:34,210 --> 00:53:36,880
You forced your men
to walk to their deaths

1063
00:53:36,920 --> 00:53:39,630
thinking only of selfish glory
and not of their--

1064
00:53:39,680 --> 00:53:40,800
[XYLO] You're wrong!

1065
00:53:40,840 --> 00:53:42,550
[MAN 1]
Your unit has a reputation

1066
00:53:42,590 --> 00:53:44,850
for its callous disregard
for authority.

1067
00:53:44,890 --> 00:53:47,100
I have also heard
of illegal activity

1068
00:53:47,140 --> 00:53:48,770
committed while dispatched.

1069
00:53:48,810 --> 00:53:50,390
We're on a battlefield!

1070
00:53:50,440 --> 00:53:52,730
A captain has to trust
his own judgement!

1071
00:53:52,770 --> 00:53:54,310
We're granted that authority.

1072
00:53:54,360 --> 00:53:56,030
[MAN 1]
An authority you only have

1073
00:53:56,070 --> 00:53:59,030
thanks to the Federated Kingdom.
Yet, still...

1074
00:53:59,070 --> 00:54:01,360
the worst of your crimes by far

1075
00:54:01,780 --> 00:54:04,740
is your murder
of the goddess Senerva.

1076
00:54:05,200 --> 00:54:07,580
Do you have any objections?

1077
00:54:07,700 --> 00:54:09,000
[grunts]
[chain clinks]

1078
00:54:10,290 --> 00:54:12,540
[XYLO] That one is true.

1079
00:54:12,580 --> 00:54:13,790
[MAN 2] Impossible!

1080
00:54:13,830 --> 00:54:15,750
[MAN 3] He killed
his own pacted goddess?

1081
00:54:15,790 --> 00:54:17,420
[MAN 4] He's lower than a beast!

1082
00:54:17,460 --> 00:54:18,550
[MAN 5] Goddess killer!

1083
00:54:18,590 --> 00:54:20,340
[MAN 6] He should be slain!

1084
00:54:20,380 --> 00:54:22,010
[MAN 7]
Death's too good for him!

1085
00:54:22,050 --> 00:54:23,260
[WOMAN 1] Despicable!

1086
00:54:23,970 --> 00:54:27,010
If there had been another way,
I would have taken it!

1087
00:54:27,640 --> 00:54:30,770
We couldn't locate the team
we were ordered to rescue.

1088
00:54:30,810 --> 00:54:33,560
The reinforcements we expected
never came.

1089
00:54:33,600 --> 00:54:35,150
We were left out there to die!

1090
00:54:35,190 --> 00:54:37,230
[MAN 1]
There were no reinforcements.

1091
00:54:37,400 --> 00:54:39,740
How could there be
when you made everything up?

1092
00:54:39,780 --> 00:54:41,780
There were no orders
for this mission.

1093
00:54:41,820 --> 00:54:42,950
Liar!

1094
00:54:43,240 --> 00:54:44,360
[chain clinks]

1095
00:54:46,120 --> 00:54:47,700
[XYLO] Senerva...

1096
00:54:47,950 --> 00:54:49,290
the goddess.

1097
00:54:49,450 --> 00:54:52,370
All she wanted was praise
for helping our team.

1098
00:54:52,710 --> 00:54:55,000
She fought
with all that she had.

1099
00:54:55,040 --> 00:54:57,590
Asking for nothing
but words of comfort.

1100
00:54:57,630 --> 00:54:59,000
[♪ sad music playing]

1101
00:54:59,050 --> 00:55:00,380
In the end,

1102
00:55:01,090 --> 00:55:03,930
she exhausted
the last of her power.

1103
00:55:06,340 --> 00:55:08,220
She was past her limit.

1104
00:55:08,510 --> 00:55:09,680
And so...

1105
00:55:10,600 --> 00:55:11,770
I...

1106
00:55:14,730 --> 00:55:17,270
[Xylo pants]

1107
00:55:17,310 --> 00:55:18,690
[Senerva chuckles lightly]

1108
00:55:19,280 --> 00:55:20,610
[Xylo whimpers]

1109
00:55:21,900 --> 00:55:23,200
[Xylo yells]

1110
00:55:24,030 --> 00:55:25,200
[chain rattles]

1111
00:55:31,750 --> 00:55:35,370
[XYLO] Do you know what happens
when a goddess loses her power?

1112
00:55:36,670 --> 00:55:39,460
She becomes weak
and defenseless.

1113
00:55:40,000 --> 00:55:41,210
And then,

1114
00:55:41,590 --> 00:55:44,510
the Demon Blight
begins to corrupt her.

1115
00:55:45,930 --> 00:55:48,430
[MAN 1] There is no record
of this phenomenon

1116
00:55:48,470 --> 00:55:51,020
ever occurring.
The Temple roundly rejects it

1117
00:55:51,060 --> 00:55:52,350
as a possibility.

1118
00:55:52,390 --> 00:55:53,770
More likely,

1119
00:55:53,810 --> 00:55:56,850
you carved an excess
of sacred seals into yourself

1120
00:55:56,900 --> 00:55:58,690
and went into a mindless rage.

1121
00:55:58,730 --> 00:55:59,900
[XYLO] What?

1122
00:55:59,940 --> 00:56:01,940
Would I still be here
if that happened?

1123
00:56:01,980 --> 00:56:03,610
I'm telling the truth!

1124
00:56:04,240 --> 00:56:06,910
[MAN 1] A goddess
being taken by the blight?

1125
00:56:06,950 --> 00:56:07,990
How absurd!

1126
00:56:08,030 --> 00:56:09,570
Just listen to me.

1127
00:56:09,620 --> 00:56:12,330
I could not allow a goddess
to be corrupted by the blight.

1128
00:56:12,370 --> 00:56:13,700
She'd wreak havoc!

1129
00:56:13,750 --> 00:56:16,370
How could we possibly stand
against a demon lord

1130
00:56:16,410 --> 00:56:19,790
wielding the unbridled power
of a goddess as their own?

1131
00:56:22,800 --> 00:56:24,220
And Senerva.

1132
00:56:24,510 --> 00:56:26,050
She understood...

1133
00:56:26,550 --> 00:56:29,350
the corruption
had already begun.

1134
00:56:29,390 --> 00:56:30,850
That's why...

1135
00:56:31,310 --> 00:56:33,060
I had to kill her.

1136
00:56:35,180 --> 00:56:36,690
[MAN 8] Lord Confessor.

1137
00:56:36,730 --> 00:56:39,020
The defendant
continues to blaspheme

1138
00:56:39,060 --> 00:56:41,480
a sacred goddess
with each word he utters.

1139
00:56:41,520 --> 00:56:44,360
We have ascertained
all that we could need to know.

1140
00:56:44,400 --> 00:56:47,320
I recommend
disallowing further speech.

1141
00:56:47,360 --> 00:56:49,110
[MAN 1] Perhaps you're right.

1142
00:56:49,160 --> 00:56:51,530
No. Hold on.
Aren't you listening?

1143
00:56:51,580 --> 00:56:53,540
Don't you see
what you're risking here?

1144
00:56:53,620 --> 00:56:57,330
You can't put blind faith
in the Temple or the military!

1145
00:56:57,750 --> 00:56:58,920
[groans]

1146
00:56:59,790 --> 00:57:01,750
You have to find them soon.

1147
00:57:01,920 --> 00:57:04,630
If you don't act fast,
it'll be too late, and...

1148
00:57:04,710 --> 00:57:06,010
[gasping]

1149
00:57:06,170 --> 00:57:08,680
[people screaming]

1150
00:57:08,970 --> 00:57:10,550
[XYLO] I see now.

1151
00:57:11,970 --> 00:57:15,890
From the beginning,
this was nothing but a setup.

1152
00:57:17,640 --> 00:57:19,770
You! All of you!

1153
00:57:20,270 --> 00:57:22,520
[punches]

1154
00:57:26,820 --> 00:57:28,820
[XYLO] I will find you,

1155
00:57:29,740 --> 00:57:31,410
whomever you are.

1156
00:57:32,410 --> 00:57:34,620
I will find you,

1157
00:57:35,990 --> 00:57:37,580
both for me

1158
00:57:37,790 --> 00:57:39,960
and my knights you doomed!

1159
00:57:40,290 --> 00:57:41,710
I'll find you

1160
00:57:41,920 --> 00:57:45,090
the one who was responsible
for Senerva's fate.

1161
00:57:45,130 --> 00:57:46,800
[LORD CONFESSOR] Xylo Forbartz.

1162
00:57:46,840 --> 00:57:48,300
I'll find you...

1163
00:57:48,340 --> 00:57:50,300
[LORD CONFESSOR]
...to serve as a hero.

1164
00:57:50,340 --> 00:57:51,890
[XYLO] And I will kill you!
